      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.15 (vs ₹0.11 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.15 (up from ₹0.11 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹512.2m (down 26% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹13.1m (up 36% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.6% (up from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 3% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 22% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
